# 代码所有权
#
# 语法见 https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners
# 后匹配优先：越靠下的规则覆盖上面的。

# 默认所有权
*                                   @platform-team

# 官方 submodule 指针：移动它等于整体升级运行时，必须走 UPSTREAM_UPGRADE.md
/.gitmodules                        @platform-team @architecture-review
/upstream/                          @platform-team @architecture-review

# 架构边界与治理门禁：改这些等于改规则本身
/scripts/check-architecture.mjs     @architecture-review
/scripts/check-secrets.mjs          @security-review @architecture-review
/scripts/upstream.mjs               @platform-team @architecture-review
/tests/architecture/                @architecture-review

# 依赖与运行时基线
/package.json                       @platform-team @architecture-review
/pnpm-workspace.yaml                @platform-team @architecture-review
/pnpm-lock.yaml                     @platform-team

# 企业装配层：决定哪些插件真正加载
/profiles/                          @platform-team @architecture-review

# 架构决策记录
/docs/enterprise/adr/               @architecture-review

# 安全相关插件与手册
/packages/enterprise/auth/          @security-review @platform-team
/packages/enterprise/tool-audit/    @security-review @platform-team
/docs/enterprise/runbooks/SECURITY_AUDIT.md  @security-review
